<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">2TI - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TI - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2TI - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">2TI - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Nga Bulus, inǝ na ndum kɛ Kristi Yesɔ ne tanyɛmɛ iye Arik, ishar tǝ bɛ bla ikpa nyak yi vli keŋ ndi ta yime nekǝ nǝ biŋ mɔr bǝn Kristi Yesɔ.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Igar bǝn Timoti, izu muŋ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Tǝ Arik ndi ai Tetɛɛ bǝn Kristi Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr be nǝgu Ita zhɔk, ilɔ susun, bǝn sik. Ki didik, iwɔ lɔ susun ben sik susun yi Arik waŋ ndi ayi Tetɛɛ ben Yesɔ Kristi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inǝk lɛ tǝ bɛ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne nkɔŋ kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Mnǝ nyɛr Arik,waŋ ndi mzǝu nǝ idur tsetser, ndi atsǝntsǝm amuŋ ne na. M nye ru ne susun tsetser, ndi M shu nzhiu iyaŋ mkpaŋ nǝ ben muŋ ibu bǝn iber. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Mnǝ shu nzhi ayi ami, tǝna wɔb tǝm yigu ngɔŋ, te susun muŋ bǝ shaga nǝ nyɛr. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />M shu nzhi tǝ itanyɛmɛ didik ndi uyimɛ neyi ndi yaŋgɔŋ ami Loyis bǝn yaa mi Yunis ne tsa ru. Mnǝ tanyɛmɛ tǝ itsara nak ri yi bǝn abɔu. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ndi iyeme M shu nzhiu tǝ ubǝ gli iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu neyi mgbamgbaŋ ndi Mnǝ sagu aŋɔk. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Tǝ Izhu ndi Arik nɛ nǝk ta ba duŋ ta klu sisik ba; ndi amɛ, izhu maa iyir miŋ mɔr tǝ nǝk ta iklik, inyer, bǝn vuŋ kpa. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Ne me duŋ te ishisha ne bla lɛ kɛ Arik amɔr ba, kɔ ubǝ te shisha yi kur ne jaru muŋ ne tu ayi zǝ Yesɔ ba. Fena ubǝ zǝm yir miŋ kɛ yik iyah ne lɛ didik, ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik, <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />waŋ ndi ne ta ta azhɔk tena zhɔ ta te ta bǝ yi ne sɔŋ kɛ tsetser ba ne kinuŋ ndi tane nai ba ama Arik ne nai ne yik maa ben ki didik. Iki didik yiŋɛ ne nek ta neyi ne min kɛ Yesɔ Kristi ne mkpaŋ kɛ kuti, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />fe Arik neka agli kɛ arumɔ ne munru yi waŋ ndi ne ta ta azhɔk, Yesɔ Kristi, waŋ ndi ne caŋ ku agli adɔmɔ tena Gli susun kɛ yaŋ ku ben kpa kɛ yaŋ be kɛ laŋ ne tu yi lɛ didik. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Nǝ tu kɛ lɛ didik kǝŋe ne nǝm bla kɛ tem na yi ne na ndum maa ben ne tsar. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Waŋ ai ki ndim zen yik iyah ma. Neme ishisha ba tem ba, tem mne nzhi waŋ ndi mne tanyɛme ben abɔu, <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Iki yiŋ ndi une wɔi ben abɛm, glii te ai yi iyi ankɔŋ ane tsar adidik, ben tanyɛme ben nyɛr ne min kɛ Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Ŋub iki didik yiŋ ndi ne nǝgu neyi duŋ Izhu Tsetser yi Arik yiŋ ndi yine akpa amɔr bǝ zo gu ŋubǝ ma.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Une zhi te kɔte ŋɔwa ne gar kɛ Asiya ne kyak me, ben Figelɔs ben Amɔgines.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Arik abɛ lɔ susun ikɛ kɔb Onesiforos, te ne duŋ susun muŋ sik bane te ishisha ndi ne kum ne jaru ba. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ndi ane nyɛ Roma, ane zen wɔb me ŋgɔŋ te anyɛ yik me. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Mben Arik te abɛ wɔ ilɔ susun ne tu maa ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ ne bɛr yuŋɔ! Une zhi ŋgɔŋ te ne nam kiki tetɛk iyi rɛ ne Afisa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Fe uwa, izu muŋ, ubǝ tsi klɛ ne iki didik yiŋ ndi yi ne Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ikiki yiŋ ndi une wɔ mne mblai ne ayi aneshir tetɛk ubǝ baŋǝ saga aneshir abaŋ ndi ate sisik Arik abaŋ ndi atei zhi tsar anuŋ. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Ubǝ vuŋ susun Gli ben abɛ ta ndi ne kpaakpa didik ayou Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Ine kpaakpa ba nek tu maa ne ikiki yi gɔŋmimi ba, anǝk tu te wa abɛ na iki yiŋ ndi ŋgɔŋ amaa atei nye ru. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Neme, waŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ kɛ abɛ klu yara akpa, ba tei ta idǝk maa ba se ne zǝ nkunkɔŋ yi klu mɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Ine na ndum kɛ ahwaŋ ŋgɔŋ ayi wa atei kuti ali ikili yi ahwaŋ amaa. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Ubǝ shu zhi iki yiŋ ndi mblau ne yi, te Arik atei nǝgu izhi iki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Ubǝ shu Yesɔ Kristi zhi, waŋ ndi ne lɛgu ne bɛ, ndi ayi ŋli kɛ nga kɛ Doda. Waŋa ayi lɛ didik muŋ, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi myik iyah ne tu maa te ne kpam ndi myi ne lalɛ. Ama ba ne kpa lɛ kɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Neme mne mvuŋ kpa ngli ne kɔte ni ne atu abaŋ ndi ne hria ba, te aba menyi abɛ yik ta zhɔk iyi Yesɔ Kristi, ben ŋgɔŋ kɛ yaŋ klɛ tu.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Waŋa ayi lɛ didik:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Ndi ta te ku ben abɔu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">Ta tei na lu ben abɔu;<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Ta te vuŋ susun Gli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">Ta tei na sɔŋ ben abɔu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ta te kyagu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">Iwa maayi atei na kyak zhi ta;<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Mba ta te tsǝn anenen ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">Iwa atei naga yi anenen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">Ba tei kyak itu maa ba.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ine na ndum waŋ ndi Arik ne tanyɛme ben abɔu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Ubǝ nak duŋ abɛ zǝ Arik abɛ ben ashu azhi ikiki yiŋɛ. Ubǝ gbaŋ ba atɔŋ ne tii kɛ Arik abɛ duŋ te antam; te ba yi iki didik ba, anaga cɔk abɛ wɔ ba la ankyak. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Ubǝ tsǝ klɛ te nek Arik itu mi ndi ne na ndum waŋ ndi ne tanyɛme ben abɔu waŋ ndi ba te shisha ba te na bla lɛ kɛ Arik anenen. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Ubǝ te shaan ne lǝlɛ yi la sak kɛ Arik, te abaŋ ndi alɛ lǝlɛ yiŋɛ izhi Arik ite shaan ben abɛba. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Lǝlɛ mǝne ibu ndi mkpaa ŋgɔŋ. Ane Himinayas bǝn Filitas ayi amɛ ne miŋ mǝne, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />abaŋ ndi ne kyak zǝ lɛ didik. Adi ilu ne bɛ ne ka gayir, tena cɔk itanyɛme yi susun kɛ anuŋ ala. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Neme, itanda kɛ klik kɛ Arik klikli mgbamgbaŋ, ne te kɛ ngir ne lɛ kǝŋe: &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ ne zhi abaŋ ndi ayi amaa,&gt;&gt; neme, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ne tanyɛme ne sak kɛ Arik atei duŋ na zumimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Nǝ kɔb ŋgɔŋ kɛ ner ne adudunki iyi ne kiki ba zineriya bǝn azurfa ankyak ba, ama iyi nkunkun bǝn ntentɛm; inuŋ iyi na ikiki didik, inuŋ ba yi na ikiki didik ba. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Fena waŋ ndi ne duŋ tu maa tsetser ne ikiki yiŋɛ, atei yi ne na ndum didik ben Arik, tsetser, atukɔ maa atei duŋu ana kɔte ndum didik ta kɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Klu iki yi tik ayi iyi nzak mi, te na ndum didik, itanyɛme ne susun, nyɛr akpa ben sik susun, ben abaŋ ndi aben Arik ne susun tsetser. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Ubǝ kyak te antam ne kinuŋ iyi isha te ba gli iki didik anyɛ me ba, ubǝ zhi te inak gli ivǝh gli nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Waŋ ndi ana ndum kɛ Arik ba vǝ ba; neme, abɛ zi tu azhɔk bǝn kɔte ŋɔwa, abɛ zhi tsar lɛ kɛ Arik, te na vuŋ susun. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Abɛ gli abaŋ ndi akyagu aŋyak ankɔŋɔ ne zi tu zhɔk, ne zhɔk susun te Arik atei duŋ ba duŋ zumimin te kam azǝ lɛ didik, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />te bǝ gli asusun amen akam nyak ankɔŋ adidik te afir aru ne atabɛrbɛr ayi shetan, ndi ne duŋ ba yi agɛn amaa te bɛ na iki wɔb maa.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Yaŋ zhi Arik ne mkpaŋ kɛ klɛ gɔŋmimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Ama uwa Timoti ubǝ zhi: aneshir atei yik iyah tetɛk ne klɛ gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Aneshir atei yi abɛ nyɛr atu amen, te nyɛr azɔb, te ŋur asa, te gli tu ne shu, te yen aneshir, te kyak wɔ lɛ kɛ abaŋ ndi ne ŋli ba, te yaŋ nyɛr ne iki yiŋ ndi ayime neyi, te yaŋ tsǝn tsetser, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />abɛ yaŋ tanyɛme ne akpa, abɛ gli akpa ne susun, te kyak akpa yi, te yaŋ vuŋ kpa gli, te yaŋ lɔ susun akpa, te kyak ikiki didik, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />abɛ na akpa ikiki mimin, te klik atu, te na gli atu adidik, te na wɔb men kɛ gɔŋmimi inaŋ zǝ Arik, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />te na ndi aba zǝ Arik ama akyak mgbyamgbyaŋ maa. Ubǝ te shaan ben abɛ ba.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Abaŋ ndi a wɔb yir akɔb aneshir te lɔm amba baŋ ndi ayi bliblik, abaŋ ndi zumimin ne shak akpa mǝne, ikiki yi tik ayi mimin ne baŋ asusun amene, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />atsar ba kɔte bɛr tayi ama ba zhi lɛ didik ba. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Ir keŋ ndi Yanisa bǝn Yambrisu ne wɔb Musa ne akla, fe aneshir abaŋa akyak lɛ didik, aneshir abɛ dur, itanyɛme men, iyi iki sha. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ama ba tei te gbagbaŋ ba, ate yi ir aneshir abaŋa, iyaŋ Mgbemgbeb mǝne itei muŋ ru.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne nek Timoti ilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Fe uwa Timoti ne tu mi, une zhi tsar muŋ, ben susun muŋ, bǝn nek susun muŋ, bǝn tanyɛme ne susun muŋ, bǝn vuŋ susun muŋ, bǝn nyɛr muŋ, bǝn vuŋ kpa muŋ, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />bǝn iyah yiŋ ndi ne sak neyi, bǝn iyah yiŋ ndi mne yige, ne ya Antakiya Ikɔni, bǝn Listira, ben ir keŋ ndi mne vuŋ kpa ne iyah yiŋ ndi ne sak me neyi. Neme, Arik ne glim agli rumɔ ne kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Ilɛ didik, waŋ ndi awɔb tsǝn anenen ne ankɔŋ ayou Yesɔ Kristi atei yik iyah yiŋɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Aner amimin bǝn abɛ lɔm aneshir atei cɔk ala anaŋ kukub, atei cɔk aneshir, atei na cɔk ba menyi. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ama uwa Timoti, ubǝ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne lɛ keŋ ndi une ka men vuŋ kɛ gli te na tanyɛme ne kɛ, te une zhi abaŋ ndi une vuŋ kɛ ben abɛ ba, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />ubǝ zhi te une zhi lɛ kɛ Arik ire vǝvǝn, keŋ ndi ne duŋu zhi lɛ kɛ ta zhɔk ndi rɛ bǝn Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Icɛr yiŋɛ bɔbɔk iyi vli kɛ Arik ndi rɛ tsar, bǝn tsaŋ, ben ŋɔk susun zhɔk ne ankɔŋ adidik, bǝn zhɔk ne ankɔŋ ane tsetser, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />te duŋ ner ayɔu Arik abɛ yi anenen ne kɔte ndum didik takɛ.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Timoti mne biŋu bǝn Arik bǝn Yesɔ Kristi, waŋ ndi atei te abɛ yi atsitsir ben abɛ ku ambuk, mna nǝgu lɛ ne atu ayi nyɛ Kristi ben Ŋgɔŋ maa, mnegu lɛ: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Ubǝ du lɛ kɛ Arik; ubǝ na klɛ kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ; bǝn ŋɔk susun zhɔk ne ankɔŋ, te na tsaŋ aneshir, te na duŋ ba klik susun, bǝn vuŋ susun bǝn tsar ba bwe. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Tǝ mkpaŋ tei nyɛ ndi aneshir ba atei klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne lɛ kɛ Arik didik ba. Neme, atei wɔb te aba bɛ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi atɔŋ amene awɔb wɔi, atei biŋ aneshir abɛ tsar tetɛk ndi atei bla ba iki yiŋ ndi aba wɔb wɔi. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Atei ku atɔŋ amen ne wɔ lɛ didik te kam awɔ nkan lǝlɛ iye atsintsim amen. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ama uwa Timoti, ubǝ vuŋ kpa gli ne kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk, vuŋ susun gli ne iyah, na ndum kɛ ne bla lɛ kɛ Arik, na ndum mi bɔbɔk.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Atei nga ane ka abwam ashur ndi ituk amkpur, mkpaŋ kɛ ŋurkam muŋ ne ka nyɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Mne nka ntsǝk mgbu didik, iklu muŋ neka tartu, mne ngli tanyɛme iyi susun. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Azizaŋa Arik ne ka aŋyak me itu anku kɛ tsǝn tsetser, ndi Arik ne te ambuk tsetser, atei nǝm idǝk muŋ ne bǝn, ba nga kiki muŋ ba, ama ben abaŋ ndi asɔŋ aŋub nyɛ Yesɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne bla kenlɛ iyi klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Uwa Timoti, tsǝ klɛ te nyɛ ben abɛm andanda, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />te Dimas, bubu iki yi gɔŋmimi ne ka vuŋu, ne kyak me aduŋ te akɔmɔ ne Tasolɔnika. Karaska ne kɔmɔ ne Galantiya, Titus ne kɔmɔ ne Dalmatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Anak ayi Luka wa ankyak ayi ben abɛm. Ubǝ gli Markus glim ma, te ayim didik ne ndum muŋ. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Nga mne shar Tikikus ne Afisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Utǝ tei nyɛ, ubǝ ka baŋ me anklu akɛ ku mvlu ndi mne ŋur kǝ nsuk bǝn Karbus ne Taruwasa, bǝn amplɛ cɛr, bǝn kpaki kɛ cɛr yuŋɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alikzanda ne lak ne nam iki mimin ŋgɔŋ. Arik wa atei ka nǝgu iki yiŋ ndi ne nai. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Iwa miyi ubǝ te zee bǝn abɔu, te ane akyak ilɛ mɔrɔ ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Nǝ mkpaŋ keŋ ndi mne kuti ŋla tu muŋ, ba nuŋ ne kum goŋ ba, bɔbɔk mǝne ne kyak me. Mben te kǝr abɛ gli ba ne lalɛ yiŋɛ ba. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ama Arik ne kliim ne goŋ te nǝm mgbyamgbyaŋ, neme tǝm du lɛ didik kɛ Arik te abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba abɛ wɔ kɛ. Nena tam azhɔk ne anu kɛ Ici. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Arik atei tam azhɔk ne kɔte ki mimin tayi te glim agar ikɔb maa keke. Ŋgɔŋ bǝ yi maa gar klɛ tu.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek yi Bulus yi klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Ubǝ tek me Bilkisu ben Akila bǝn aner kɔb Onisifaras. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Arastas ne klɛ ne kɔrantiya, mne duŋ Tarofimas ne Milita, ikpa ne ŋuru vuŋ. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ubǝ nama te nyɛ kǝr ubǝ duŋ ikus bǝ te ba. Ane, Aubulus, bǝn Budis, bǝn linas, bǝn Kaludiya, bǝn abɛ zǝ Arik bɔbɔk ategu.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Arik abɛ yi bǝn asusun amin. Iki didik bǝ yi bǝn abɛ zhin.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>